#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/zerotier/controller.js:183
msgid "A /80 per member, for containers or VMs behind it."
msgstr "每个成员一个 /80，供其后面的容器或虚拟机使用。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/zerotier/gateway.js:246
msgid ""
"A local host name that follows a device between its own ZeroTier client and "
"its mapped LAN address: the router checks every minute which of the two "
"answers and points the name there (dnsmasq)."
msgstr "让一个本地主机名跟随设备在\"自身 ZeroTier 客户端地址\"和\"局域网映射地址\"之间切换：路由器每分钟检查哪一个能连通，就把名字指向哪一个（dnsmasq）。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/zerotier/permissions.js:270
msgid ""
"A member is recognized by the MAC address ZeroTier derives from its node "
"address, never by IP, so it cannot borrow another member's grants by taking "
"its address."
msgstr "成员按 ZeroTier 由节点地址推导出的 MAC 地址识别，从不按 IP 识别，因此无法通过冒用他人的 IP 借用别人的授权。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/zerotier/moon.js:161
msgid "A moon ID has 10 hexadecimal digits"
msgstr "Moon ID 是 10 位十六进制数"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/zerotier/moon.js:92
msgid ""
"A moon is a root server of your own: nodes that orbit it find each other "
"through it, faster and without depending on the public roots. Its endpoints "
"have to be reachable from where those nodes are."
msgstr "Moon 是自建的根服务器：加入它的节点通过它互相发现，更快，也不依赖公共根服务器。它发布的地址必须能被这些节点访问到。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/zerotier/settings.js:74
msgid "A network ID has 16 hexadecimal digits"
msgstr "网络 ID 是 16 位十六进制数"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/zerotier/permissions.js:298
msgid "A node address has 10 hexadecimal digits"
msgstr "节点地址是 10 位十六进制数"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/zerotier/permissions.js:323
msgid ""
"A role is a set of grants several members share: listing a role on a member "
"gives it every grant of the role. A role is also a group: under member "
"isolation, \"group:ROLE\" grants reach its members, and with \"Members reach "
"each other\" they reach one another directly."
msgstr "角色是多个成员共用的一组授权：给成员列上某个角色，它就获得该角色的全部授权。角色同时也是分组：启用成员隔离后，\"group:角色名\" 授权可以访问该组的成员；勾选\"组内互通\"后，组内成员可以直接互相访问。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/zerotier/controller.js:174
msgid "A route needs a subnet such as 10.147.20.0/24"
msgstr "路由需要一个子网，例如 10.147.20.0/24"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/zerotier/controller.js:181
msgid "A unique /128 per member, derived from network and node."
msgstr "每个成员一个唯一的 /128，由网络和节点推导。"

